eenshot, in the editor, it select the ground but with AABB in game view, it select the mesh.\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cce9c142-103a-4e07-a73f-cbb94023e385)\r\n\r\nI think the previous selection using the collision mesh was more precise and what the user expects.","created_at":"2025-01-09T22:44:32Z","updated_at":"2025-01-09T22:45:01Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101368#discussion_r1909552141","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101368","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1909552141"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101368#discussion_r1909552141"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101368"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1909552141/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":42,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1909435963,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":4,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1909580914","pull_request_review_id":2541143940,"id":1909580914,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5x0eRy","diff_hunk":"@@ -39,6 +39,7 @@\n #include \"scene/2d/physics/collision_polygon_2d.h\"\n #include \"scene/2d/physics/collision_shape_2d.h\"\n #ifndef _3D_DISABLED\n+#include \"modules/csg/csg_shape.h\"","path":"scene/debugger/scene_debugger.cpp","commit_id":"055b418e4dc86b31ff42584b1b89d57fefbb409a","original_commit_id":"1d746c45a55ef18930d6c5f59b87525250ed8ade","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I added `generate_triangle_mesh()` in `GeometryInstance3D` and implemented overrides in `CSGShape`, `Label3D`, `MeshInstance3D` and `SpriteBase3D` as suggested by @YeldhamDev\r\n\r\nNote: Using get AABB dit not work for GPUParticle3D.\r\n\r\nJust for information and maybe it could help in the futur, here is the code that I used trying the AABB:\r\n```c++\r\nVisualInstance3D *instance_3d = Object::cast_to<VisualInstance3D>(obj);\r\nif (instance_3d) {\r\n\tVector3 point;\r\n\tbool inside = false;\r\n\tTransform3D gt = instance_3d->get_global_transform();\r\n\tTransform3D ai = gt.affine_inverse();\r\n\tif (instance_3d->get_aabb().find_intersects_ray(ai.xform(pos), ai.basis.xform(ray).normalized(), inside, &point)) {\r\n\t\tSelectResult res;\r\n\t\tres.item = Object::cast_to<Node>(obj);\r\n\t\tres.order = -pos.distance_to(gt.xform(point));\r\n\t\tr_items.push_back(res);\r\n\r\n\t\tcontinue;\r\n\t}\r\n}\r\n```","created_at":"2025-01-09T23:26:22Z","updated_at":"2025-01-09T23:29:12Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101368#discussion_r1909580914","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101368","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1909580914"},"html":{"href":"https